/rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一旦切断了封面,则无法返回纸张。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">風景</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうけい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">风景；景色；景观；景象；场景；现场（如犯罪现场）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200556\">とても<ruby>美<rp>(</rp><rt>うつく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>風景<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいくつかありました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有几个非常美丽的景色。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">封鎖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">封锁；封闭；冻结（资金）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221978\">この<ruby>港<rp>(</rp><rt>みなと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>封鎖<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されうる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个港口可能会遭到封锁。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13924822\" title=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">風習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">风俗；习俗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206926\">その<ruby>風習<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすた