>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けたのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谁打破了这个封面?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">風土</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自然特征；地形；气候；人文特性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫婦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうふ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夫妇；夫妻；婚配的夫妇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217025\">ご<ruby>夫婦<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でお<ruby>越<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请与你的夫妻一起来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不運</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふうん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不幸；厄运；霉运</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104750\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>失敗<rp>(</rp><rt>しっぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>不運<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のせいにした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不幸地责怪失败。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">フェリー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\"